{"t":"OMC","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Omnicom Group Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","employees":120000,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.omc.com","summary_en":"Omnicom Group Inc., together with its subsidiaries, offers advertising, marketing, and corporate communications services. It provides a range of services in the areas of media and advertising, precision marketing, public relations, healthcare, branding and retail commerce, experiential, execution, and support. The company's services include advertising, branding, content marketing, crisis communications, customer data analytics and data-driven decision making, customer relationship management, decision sciences, digital experience design, digital transformation, e-commerce optimization, entertainment marketing, experiential marketing, field marketing, healthcare marketing and communications, in-store design, investor relations, and marketing research.Its services also comprise media planning and buying, merchandising and point of sale, mobile marketing, multi-cultural marketing, organizational communications, package design, performance marketing, product placement, promotional marketing, public affairs, public relations, retail media and e-commerce, shopper marketing, structured innovation, studio production, social media and influencer marketing, and sports and event marketing. It operates in the North and Latin America, Europe, the Middle East and Africa (EMEA), and the Asia Pacific. The company was incorporated in 1944 and is based in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Omnicom Group Inc.는 자회사와 함께 광고, 마케팅 및 기업 커뮤니케이션 서비스를 제공합니다. 미디어 및 광고, 정밀 마케팅, 홍보, 의료, 브랜딩 및 소매 상거래, 경험, 실행 및 지원 분야에서 다양한 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사의 서비스에는 광고, 브랜딩, 콘텐츠 마케팅, 위기 커뮤니케이션, 고객 데이터 분석 및 데이터 중심 의사 결정, 고객 관계 관리, 의사 결정 과학, 디지털 경험 디자인, 디지털 혁신, 전자 상거래 최적화, 엔터테인먼트 마케팅, 체험 마케팅, 현장 마케팅, 의료 마케팅 및 커뮤니케이션, 매장 내 디자인, 투자자 관계 및 마케팅 연구가 포함됩니다. 또한 서비스에는 미디어 계획 및 구매, 상품화 및 POS, 모바일 마케팅, 다문화 마케팅, 조직 커뮤니케이션, 패키지 디자인, 퍼포먼스 마케팅, 제품 배치, 판촉 마케팅, 홍보, 홍보, 소매 미디어 및 전자 상거래, 구매자 마케팅, 구조적 혁신, 스튜디오 제작, 소셜 미디어 및 영향력 있는 마케팅, 스포츠 및 이벤트 마케팅. 북미 및 라틴 아메리카, 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카(EMEA), 아시아 태평양 지역에서 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 1944년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕 주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":87.09,"mcap":23892787200.0,"pe":87.969696,"fpe":7.818012,"peg":null,"ps":0.9650922,"pb":2.38799,"ev_ebitda":7.686,"div":3.67,"beta":0.737,"hi52":89.57,"lo52":66.33},"fin":{"rev":24757000192.0,"rev_g":0.591,"eps_g":0.36,"gross":0.19332,"op":0.15725,"net":0.028469998,"roe":0.09942,"fcf":4594287616.0,"cash":3796400128.0,"debt":11361000448.0,"de":107.252,"eps":0.99,"feps":11.13966},"own":{"short":0.0889,"inst":1.11013,"insider":0.00945},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":101.41667,"median":100.0,"high":130.0,"low":77.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.07692,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":87.0,"priorPriceTarget":88.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":85.0,"priorPriceTarget":83.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":111.0,"priorPriceTarget":115.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":97.0,"priorPriceTarget":93.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade